### Research kitchen — entirely out of the repository
# Holds notebooks with stored outputs (13 MB of base64 images in one of them),
# competition data, experiment notes, legacy datasets, search runs.
# Data also stays out by Kaggle rules: everyone downloads it themselves.
# See workbook/data/README.md; code looks under workbook/data/raw, overridable
# with TITANIC_RAW_DIR.
workbook/

