### Model artifacts
# Weights and fitted pipelines ship via GitHub Releases: binaries bloat git
# history irreversibly. The metrics manifest is the opposite — it belongs in
# the repo, hence the exception.
model_artifacts/*
!model_artifacts/metrics.json
!model_artifacts/input_schema.json
*.joblib
*.safetensors
*.npz

